msgid "Explorer default prompts"
msgstr "探索器默认提示词"

msgid "Customize the example prompts shown when Grok is selected in compatible Drupal AI Explorers. Existing user input is never replaced. Leave a prompt blank to disable its default."
msgstr "自定义在兼容的 Drupal AI 探索器中选择 Grok 时显示的示例提示词。现有用户输入绝不会被替换。将提示词留空可禁用其默认值。"

msgid "Chat prompt"
msgstr "聊天提示词"

msgid "Image-to-image prompt"
msgstr "图生图提示词"

msgid "Text-to-video prompt"
msgstr "文生视频提示词"

msgid "Moderation prompt"
msgstr "内容审核提示词"

msgid "Text-to-image prompt"
msgstr "文生图提示词"

msgid "Text-to-speech prompt"
msgstr "文本转语音提示词"

msgid "Grok xAi Provider"
msgstr "Grok xAi 提供商"

msgid "Grok AI Provider"
msgstr "Grok AI 提供商"

msgid "Unofficial"
msgstr "非官方"

msgid "Text to Video"
msgstr "文本生成视频"

msgid "Generate a short video from a text prompt."
msgstr "根据文本提示生成短视频。"

msgid "Text-To-Video Generation Explorer"
msgstr "文本生成视频探索器"

msgid "Experiment with Grok text-to-video generation."
msgstr "试用 Grok 文本生成视频。"

msgid "Describe the video to generate."
msgstr "描述要生成的视频。"

msgid "Generate a Video"
msgstr "生成视频"

msgid "Video generation failed"
msgstr "视频生成失败"

msgid "Video duration"
msgstr "视频时长"

msgid "These settings permit tools at site level. Individual requests must still select a permitted tool. Hosted tools can incur additional xAI charges."
msgstr "这些设置在站点级别允许工具。每个请求仍须选择已允许的工具。托管工具可能产生额外的 xAI 费用。"
msgid "Allows Grok to search and browse the public web for current information. Requests can optionally restrict searches to allowed or excluded domains and enable image search or image understanding. xAI charges separately for hosted search calls."
msgstr "允许 Grok 搜索和浏览公共网络以获取最新信息。请求可以限制允许或排除的域名，并启用图像搜索或理解。xAI 会对托管搜索单独收费。"
msgid "Allows Grok to search public posts, users, and threads on X. Individual requests can restrict handles and dates or enable image and video understanding. xAI charges separately for hosted search calls."
msgstr "允许 Grok 搜索 X 上的公开帖子、用户和话题。请求可以限制账号和日期，或启用图像与视频理解。xAI 会对托管搜索单独收费。"
msgid "Allows Grok to write and execute Python in an isolated environment managed by xAI. It is useful for calculations and data analysis. The environment has no access to this Drupal site unless data is included in the prompt, and tool calls may incur additional charges."
msgstr "允许 Grok 在 xAI 管理的隔离环境中编写并执行 Python，适用于计算和数据分析。除非提示中包含数据，否则该环境无法访问此 Drupal 站点。工具调用可能产生额外费用。"
msgid "Allows Grok to search xAI collections containing previously uploaded documents. Individual requests must provide permitted collection IDs. Collection storage, retrieval, and search can incur additional xAI charges."
msgstr "允许 Grok 搜索包含已上传文档的 xAI 集合。请求必须提供已允许的集合 ID。集合存储、检索和搜索可能产生额外费用。"
msgid "Allows xAI to connect Grok to explicitly allowlisted remote MCP servers. Each server must use HTTPS and expose only the tool names listed below. Enable this only for trusted servers because MCP tools may read or modify external systems."
msgstr "允许 xAI 将 Grok 连接到明确列入允许名单的远程 MCP 服务器。服务器必须使用 HTTPS，并仅公开下列工具。MCP 工具可能读取或修改外部系统，因此只应为可信服务器启用。"
msgid "After saving a working xAI API key and default Grok model, connect Grok to the Drupal AI features that should use it:"
msgstr "保存有效的 xAI API 密钥和默认 Grok 模型后，将 Grok 连接到需要使用它的 Drupal AI 功能："
msgid "Use <strong>Test connection and load models</strong>, select the Grok model you want this provider to use by default, and save this form."
msgstr "使用<strong>测试连接并加载模型</strong>，选择此提供商默认使用的 Grok 模型，然后保存表单。"
msgid "Open <a href=\":url\">Default Models for AI Operations</a> and select <strong>Grok (xAI)</strong> for Chat, Text To Image, and Text To Video. Choose the appropriate Grok chat and Grok Imagine models for features that rely on site-wide defaults."
msgstr "打开<a href=\":url\">AI 操作的默认模型</a>，为聊天、文本生成图像和文本生成视频选择 <strong>Grok (xAI)</strong>，并为依赖全站默认值的功能选择合适的模型。"
msgid "Review each Drupal AI module or feature you enable. Configure it to use the site-wide Chat default, or select Grok explicitly when that feature provides its own provider and model settings."
msgstr "检查每个已启用的 Drupal AI 模块或功能。将其配置为使用全站 Chat 默认值；若该功能有独立设置，则明确选择 Grok。"
msgid "Grok supports Chat-based text, vision, function tools, structured output, text-to-image generation, and text-to-video generation. Operations such as embeddings and speech require another provider that supports those operation types."
msgstr "Grok 支持聊天文本、视觉、函数工具、结构化输出、文本生成图像和文本生成视频。嵌入和语音等操作需要其他支持相应类型的提供商。"
msgid "To use xAI-hosted tools, permit them in <strong>Hosted tool permissions</strong>, then enable the permitted tools in the individual model or request configuration that needs them."
msgstr "要使用 xAI 托管工具，请先在<strong>托管工具权限</strong>中允许它们，再在需要这些工具的模型或请求配置中启用。"

msgid "Provides Grok models from xAI to the Drupal AI modules."
msgstr "为 Drupal AI 模块提供 xAI 的 Grok 模型。"

msgid "AI Providers"
msgstr "AI 提供商"

msgid "Grok authentication"
msgstr "Grok 身份验证"

msgid "Configure access to the xAI API."
msgstr "配置对 xAI API 的访问。"

msgid "Configure Grok authentication, models, transports, and hosted tools."
msgstr "配置 Grok 身份验证、模型、传输方式和托管工具。"

msgid "Configure Grok Integrations"
msgstr "配置 Grok 集成"

msgid "xAI API key"
msgstr "xAI API 密钥"

msgid "Select a Key containing an API key created in the xAI Console."
msgstr "选择一个包含在 xAI 控制台中创建的 API 密钥的密钥。"

msgid "Advanced settings"
msgstr "高级设置"

msgid "API base URL"
msgstr "API 基础 URL"

msgid "Transport"
msgstr "传输方式"

msgid "Automatic (recommended)"
msgstr "自动（推荐）"

msgid "Chat Completions only"
msgstr "仅 Chat Completions"

msgid "Responses API for compatible requests"
msgstr "对兼容请求使用 Responses API"

msgid "Allow xAI to store Responses API requests"
msgstr "允许 xAI 存储 Responses API 请求"

msgid "Responses request timeout"
msgstr "Responses 请求超时"

msgid "Test connection"
msgstr "测试连接"

msgid "Test connection and load models"
msgstr "测试连接并加载模型"

msgid "Default Grok model"
msgstr "默认 Grok 模型"

msgid "Hosted tool permissions"
msgstr "托管工具权限"

msgid "Permit Web Search"
msgstr "允许网页搜索"

msgid "Permit X Search"
msgstr "允许 X 搜索"

msgid "Permit Code Interpreter"
msgstr "允许代码解释器"

msgid "Permit Collections Search"
msgstr "允许集合搜索"

msgid "Permit allowlisted remote MCP servers"
msgstr "允许已列入许可名单的远程 MCP 服务器"

msgid "Remote MCP server allowlist"
msgstr "远程 MCP 服务器许可名单"

msgid "About"
msgstr "关于"

msgid "Next Steps"
msgstr "后续步骤"

msgid "Try the configured models in the <a href=\":chat_url\">Chat Generation Explorer</a>, <a href=\":image_url\">Text-To-Image Generation Explorer</a>, and <a href=\":video_url\">Text-To-Video Generation Explorer</a>."
msgstr "在<a href=\":chat_url\">聊天生成探索器</a>、<a href=\":image_url\">文本生成图像探索器</a>和<a href=\":video_url\">文本生成视频探索器</a>中试用已配置的模型。"

msgid "To use Grok in CKEditor, enable the <strong>AI CKEditor integration</strong> module, then open <a href=\":url\">Text formats and editors</a>. Edit each CKEditor 5 text format that needs AI, add the AI button to its active toolbar, enable the required AI actions, and select <strong>Grok (xAI)</strong> with a Grok chat model for each action, or verify that the action uses the site-wide Chat default. Also grant the appropriate roles the <em>use ai ckeditor</em> permission."
msgstr "要在 CKEditor 中使用 Grok，请启用 <strong>AI CKEditor 集成</strong>模块，然后打开<a href=\":url\">文本格式和编辑器</a>。编辑每个需要 AI 的 CKEditor 5 文本格式，将 AI 按钮添加到启用的工具栏，启用所需的 AI 操作，并为每个操作选择 <strong>Grok (xAI)</strong> 和 Grok 聊天模型，或确认该操作使用全站 Chat 默认设置。还要向适当的角色授予 <em>use ai ckeditor</em> 权限。"

msgid "Number of images"
msgstr "图像数量"

msgid "Aspect ratio"
msgstr "宽高比"

msgid "Resolution"
msgstr "分辨率"

msgid "Request transparent background"
msgstr "请求透明背景"

msgid "Version: @version"
msgstr "版本：@version"

msgid "seconds"
msgstr "秒"

msgid "The selected Key does not contain an API key."
msgstr "所选密钥不包含 API 密钥。"

msgid "Could not authenticate with xAI: @message"
msgstr "无法通过 xAI 进行身份验证：@message"

msgid "Connection failed: @message"
msgstr "连接失败：@message"

msgid "xAI did not return any accessible Grok models for this key."
msgstr "xAI 未返回此密钥可访问的任何 Grok 模型。"
msgid "An image editing prompt is required."
msgstr "需要提供图像编辑提示词。"

msgid "Upload the source image you want Grok to edit."
msgstr "上传您希望 Grok 编辑的源图像。"

msgid "Describe the requested changes in the prompt below. Image editing can take time to complete and each request may count against your xAI API usage."
msgstr "请在下方提示词中描述所需的更改。图像编辑可能需要一些时间，每次请求都可能计入您的 xAI API 使用量。"

msgid "Prompt"
msgstr "提示词"

msgid "Describe how Grok should change the source image."
msgstr "请描述 Grok 应如何修改源图像。"

msgid "Text content to assess for potentially harmful material."
msgstr "用于评估是否包含潜在有害内容的文本。"

msgid "An image and optional candidate labels to classify."
msgstr "要分类的图像以及可选的候选标签。"

msgid "Maximum labels"
msgstr "最大标签数"

msgid "Maximum number of labels Grok may return when candidate labels are not supplied."
msgstr "未提供候选标签时，Grok 可以返回的最大标签数量。"

msgid "Configure Grok as the default for Image Classification and Moderation, then test it in the <a href=\":classification_url\">Image Classification Explorer</a> and <a href=\":moderation_url\">Moderation Explorer</a>. Moderation is a model-based assessment, not a dedicated xAI safety endpoint."
msgstr "将 Grok 配置为图像分类和内容审核的默认提供商，然后在<a href=\":classification_url\">图像分类探索器</a>和<a href=\":moderation_url\">内容审核探索器</a>中进行测试。内容审核是基于模型的评估，并非 xAI 专用的安全端点。"

msgid "Select an xAI voice for Text To Speech and xAI Speech to Text for Speech To Text, then test them in the <a href=\":tts_url\">Text-To-Speech Explorer</a> and <a href=\":stt_url\">Speech-To-Text Explorer</a>."
msgstr "为文本转语音选择一个 xAI 语音，并为语音转文本选择 xAI Speech to Text，然后在<a href=\":tts_url\">文本转语音探索器</a>和<a href=\":stt_url\">语音转文本探索器</a>中测试。"

msgid "Grok supports Chat-based text, vision, function tools, structured output, text-to-image generation, image-to-image editing, image-to-video generation, text-to-video generation, text-to-speech, and speech-to-text. Operations such as embeddings require another provider that supports those operation types."
msgstr "Grok 支持聊天文本、视觉、函数工具、结构化输出、文本生成图像、图像编辑、图像生成视频、文本生成视频、文本转语音和语音转文本。嵌入等操作需要其他支持这些类型的提供商。"

